    "description": "The Event Ticket Transfer API enables the seamless transfer of tickets between users within the event ticketing system. This operation is particularly beneficial for event organizers and ticket sales platforms that need to facilitate resales or transfers of tickets among end-users. Using the PUT method, this API allows for the update of ticket ownership details, ensuring accurate and timely access to events. Typical consumers include event coordinators, ticketing vendors, and users looking to transfer their tickets to others.",
